// AWS IAM Federation Provider Created or Modified  [tier: alert]  ATT&CK: T1556, T1199
// Detects creation/modification of a SAML or OIDC identity provider (CreateSAMLProvider, UpdateSAMLProvider, CreateOpenIDConnectProvider). A…
// False positives: Planned SSO/federation setup by the identity team.
// Source: rules/persistence/iam-create-saml-oidc-provider.yml — generated by scripts/build_dist.py; adjust field names to your CloudTrail schema.
(eventName in~ ("CreateSAMLProvider", "UpdateSAMLProvider", "CreateOpenIDConnectProvider")) and eventSource =~ "iam.amazonaws.com"
